{"3753150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drag'N Dungeon", "steam_appid": 3753150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/260fe746844431821e8e1f2edb762481.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/260fe746844431821e8e1f2edb762481.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/260fe746844431821e8e1f2edb762481.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag’N Dungeon is a single-player tactical auto-battler with real-time strategy elements. Find and unlock the right champions, drop them onto the battlefield, and lead them to victory to overcome increasingly tough challenges and escape the dungeon. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drop Your Best Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/5c4c600e4091271374e6e1f3f37bcd7b.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/5c4c600e4091271374e6e1f3f37bcd7b.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/5c4c600e4091271374e6e1f3f37bcd7b.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 40 unique heroes, each with their own abilities and stats. Mix, match, and master the perfect team combos to overcome deadly traps, tricky enemies, and mind-bending challenges. Escape isn’t given — it’s earned one drop at a time! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/e449df8a9fc00f4415be25cc49ee6936.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/e449df8a9fc00f4415be25cc49ee6936.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/e449df8a9fc00f4415be25cc49ee6936.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon will challenge you with dozens of trials and reward every victory. Face each room wisely, mindful of your team’s abilities and resources. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/902b8d12e4d95846cf66c30a048695f8.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/902b8d12e4d95846cf66c30a048695f8.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/902b8d12e4d95846cf66c30a048695f8.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero can bring you closer to victory — or set you back. Study your opponents carefully and hold your nerve: patience and strategy will lead you through. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid-Free Auto-Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/a0b053edf24f46e58bc014731b11f4c8.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/a0b053edf24f46e58bc014731b11f4c8.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/a0b053edf24f46e58bc014731b11f4c8.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no grid to limit your strategies, but be prepared to fight in tight spaces. Unleash your creativity and use every inch of the battlefield to your advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready to drag your way out — if you dare! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >© 2026 Tambù S.r.l. — All rights reserved. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/260fe746844431821e8e1f2edb762481.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/260fe746844431821e8e1f2edb762481.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/260fe746844431821e8e1f2edb762481.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag’N Dungeon is a single-player tactical auto-battler with real-time strategy elements. Find and unlock the right champions, drop them onto the battlefield, and lead them to victory to overcome increasingly tough challenges and escape the dungeon. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drop Your Best Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/5c4c600e4091271374e6e1f3f37bcd7b.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/5c4c600e4091271374e6e1f3f37bcd7b.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/5c4c600e4091271374e6e1f3f37bcd7b.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 40 unique heroes, each with their own abilities and stats. Mix, match, and master the perfect team combos to overcome deadly traps, tricky enemies, and mind-bending challenges. Escape isn’t given — it’s earned one drop at a time! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/e449df8a9fc00f4415be25cc49ee6936.poster.avif?t=1785943853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/e449df8a9fc00f4415be25cc49ee6936.webm?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753150/extras/e449df8a9fc00f4415be25cc49ee6936.mp4?t=1785943853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon will challenge you with dozens of trials and reward every victory. Face each room wisely, mindful of your team’s abilities and resources. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste